 suy ra  $\Delta{GHE}=\Delta{HGF}$ (c-g-c)

c) Vì $\Delta{GHE}=\Delta{HGF}$ suy ra $\widehat{ GEH } = \widehat{ HFG}$ (hai góc tương ứng)

