 $\dfrac{HE}{HG}=\dfrac{FE}{FG}\Rightarrow \dfrac{HE}{16}=\dfrac{HG}{34}=\dfrac{HE+HG}{50}=\dfrac{30}{50}=\dfrac{3}{5}$ (dãy tỉ số bằng nhau)

